{"translation-revision-date":"2026-11-02 16:03:38+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.1.0","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;","lang":"hu"},"Upgrade to create %s variables and maintain consistent element sizing.":["Friss\u00edtsen %s v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3k l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1s\u00e1hoz \u00e9s az elemm\u00e9ret konzisztens fenntart\u00e1s\u00e1hoz."],"No %s variables yet":["M\u00e9g nincsenek %s v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3k"],"Upgrade to continue creating and editing %s variables.":["Friss\u00edtsen, hogy folytathassa a %s v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3k l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1s\u00e1t \u00e9s szerkeszt\u00e9s\u00e9t."],"%s variables":["%s v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3"],"Please rename the variables.":["K\u00e9rj\u00fck, nevezze \u00e1t a v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3kat."],"We found %1$d duplicated %2$s.":["%1$d ism\u00e9tl\u0151d\u0151 elemet tal\u00e1ltunk: %2$s."],"No compatible variables":["Nincsenek kompatibilis v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3k"],"Add variable":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"Delete variable":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 t\u00f6rl\u00e9se"],"Unlink variable":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 lev\u00e1laszt\u00e1sa"],"changed":["megv\u00e1ltozott"],"Select variable":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 kiv\u00e1laszt\u00e1sa"],"This variable is no longer compatible with this property. You can clear it or select a different one.":["Ez a v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 m\u00e1r nem kompatibilis ezzel a tulajdons\u00e1ggal. T\u00f6r\u00f6lheti, vagy v\u00e1laszthat egy m\u00e1sikat."],"Variable has changed":["A v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 megv\u00e1ltozott"],"Don't show me again":["Ne mutasd \u00fajra"],"Changes to variables go live right away.":["A v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3kon v\u00e9grehajtott m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sok azonnal \u00e9letbe l\u00e9pnek."],"Variables Manager":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3kezel\u0151"],"There was a glitch. Try saving your variable again.":["Hiba t\u00f6rt\u00e9nt. Pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja meg \u00fajra elmenteni a v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3t."],"This variable name already exists. Please choose a unique name.":["Ez a v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 n\u00e9v m\u00e1r l\u00e9tezik. K\u00e9rj\u00fck, v\u00e1lasszon egy egyedi nevet."],"Keep names up to 50 characters.":["A nevek hossza legfeljebb 50 karakter lehet."],"Names have to include at least one non-special character.":["A neveknek legal\u00e1bb egy nem speci\u00e1lis karaktert kell tartalmazniuk."],"Use letters, numbers, dashes (-), or underscores (_) for the name.":["A n\u00e9vhez bet\u0171ket, sz\u00e1mokat, k\u00f6t\u0151jeleket (-) vagy al\u00e1h\u00faz\u00e1sjeleket (_) haszn\u00e1ljon."],"Add a value to complete your variable.":["Adjon meg egy \u00e9rt\u00e9ket a v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 befejez\u00e9s\u00e9hez."],"deleted":["t\u00f6r\u00f6lve"],"Unexpected response from server":["V\u00e1ratlan v\u00e1lasz a szervert\u0151l"],"Missing variable":["Hi\u00e1nyz\u00f3 v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3"],"There are no variables":["Nincsenek v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3k"],"Create a variable":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1sa"],"Variables are saved attributes that you can apply anywhere on your site.":["A v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3k mentett attrib\u00fatumok, amelyeket a webhely b\u00e1rmely pontj\u00e1n alkalmazhat."],"It may have been deleted. Try clearing this field and select a different value or variable.":["Lehets\u00e9ges, hogy t\u00f6r\u00f6lt\u00e9k. Pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja meg t\u00f6r\u00f6lni ezt a mez\u0151t, \u00e9s v\u00e1lasszon m\u00e1sik \u00e9rt\u00e9ket vagy v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3t."],"Deleted variable":["T\u00f6r\u00f6lt v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3"],"This variable is missing":["Ez a v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 hi\u00e1nyzik"],"has been deleted, but it is still referenced in this location. You may restore the variable or unlink it to assign a different value.":["t\u00f6r\u00f6lve lett, de tov\u00e1bbra is hivatkoznak r\u00e1 ezen a helyen. Vissza\u00e1ll\u00edthatja a v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3t, vagy lev\u00e1laszthatja, hogy m\u00e1sik \u00e9rt\u00e9ket rendeljen hozz\u00e1."],"The variable":["A v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3"],"will keep their current values, but the variable itself will be removed.":["megtartj\u00e1k jelenlegi \u00e9rt\u00e9keiket, de maga a v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1sra ker\u00fcl."],"All elements using":["Minden elem haszn\u00e1lja"],"Delete this variable?":["T\u00f6rli ezt a v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3t?"],"Create your first %s variable":["Hozza l\u00e9tre az els\u0151 %s v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3t"],"Restore variable":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 vissza\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Edit variable":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 szerkeszt\u00e9se"],"Create variable":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3 l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1sa"],"Value":["\u00c9rt\u00e9k"],"To avoid losing your updates, save your changes before leaving.":["A friss\u00edt\u00e9sek elveszt\u00e9s\u00e9nek elker\u00fcl\u00e9se \u00e9rdek\u00e9ben mentse el a m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sokat, miel\u0151tt kil\u00e9p."],"You have unsaved changes":["Nem mentett m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sai vannak"],"Save changes":["V\u00e1ltoztat\u00e1sok ment\u00e9se"],"Font family":["Bet\u0171t\u00edpuscsal\u00e1d"],"Variables":["V\u00e1ltoz\u00f3k"],"Sorry, nothing matched":["Sajn\u00e1lom, semmi sem tal\u00e1lt"],"There was a glitch.":["Volt egy hiba."],"Upgrade now":["Friss\u00edt\u00e9s most"],"Take me there":["Vigy\u00e9l oda"],"Got it":["Meg\u00e9rtettem"],"Create":["L\u00e9trehoz"],"Restore":["Vissza\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s"],"Keep editing":["Szerkeszt\u00e9s folytat\u00e1sa"],"Search":["Keres\u00e9s"],"Duplicate":["Megkett\u0151z\u00e9s"],"Go Back":["Vissza"],"Cancel":["M\u00e9gse"],"Name":["N\u00e9v"],"Discard":["Eldob"],"Save":["Ment\u00e9s"],"Delete":["T\u00f6rl\u00e9s"],"Clear":["T\u00f6rl\u00e9s"],"Unlink":["Lev\u00e1laszt\u00e1s"]}},"comment":{"reference":"assets\/js\/packages\/editor-variables\/editor-variables.js"}}